.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/F6543A>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/F94C34>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/FFC35B>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/FGF4G9>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/G29AD2>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/G45985>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/G56825>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/G7497F> ;
