  skos:narrower <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/C84834>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/A42FG3>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/FA5484>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/F75BDB>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/AD3B58>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/D74F9D>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/B452DG>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/CGGB4G>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/D1788D>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/D8B5C3>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/F68381>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/F9GC9A>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/FD27A8> ;
