  skos:broaderTransitive <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/B51DAF>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/BC5B57>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/C4BCF8>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/CA1BC5>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/GD172G>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/CD3341>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/F3G8D1>, <https://www.w3id.org/archlink/terms/conservationthesaurus/A9A858> ;
